    {
      "turn": 3,
      "doctor_question": "During these past couple of years, have you had times where you felt unusually energetic, wired, or full of energy for days on end?",
      "targeted_symptom": "S034",
      "patient_response": "Oh, energetic... yeah. Yeah, sometimes I get so wired. When that energy comes, I just cannot sit still at all. I'll be at work and I'll clean the exact same hallway over and over again. I start moving all the chairs around in the lobby, making lists of things, and I just keep walking and walking even when my feet hurt so bad. \n\nMy feet ache a lot because of these boots I bought. I got them at this army surplus store off 4th street, and the guy who sold them to me, he had a glass eye. You could tell because it just stared straight ahead while his other eye looked down at the cash register. Cash registers used to be so heavy, you know? Made of solid metal with those big buttons you had to really push down on to make them ring. Now everything is just a flat screen. You just tap it. Tap, tap, tap. Like a woodpecker. We had a woodpecker outside my window last spring, just drilling into the old oak tree out back. Making holes everywhere. Just endless little holes in the wood...",
